                        "entry_id": "858fd1e4-c722-3f0a-9d3a-4404cd2943a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any arboreal marsupial of genera Ailurops, Phalanger, Spilocuscus, and Strigocuscus, all in the family Phalangeridae, native to Australia."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
